### 31. Record a mandi price (admin) — the path the future Ingestion module will also call
# @name recordPrice
POST {{host}}/api/v1/admin/pricing/records
Authorization: Bearer {{accessToken}}
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "productId": "{{products.response.body.$.data[0].id}}",
  "unitId": "{{products.response.body.$.data[0].defaultUnit.id}}",
  "locationKind": "Mandi",
  "mandiId": "{{adminMandi.response.body.$.data.id}}",
