### --- Alerting ---

### 39. Create an alert rule — fires on a 5% drop for this product at this mandi
# @name createAlertRule
POST {{host}}/api/v1/alert-rules
Authorization: Bearer {{accessToken}}
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "productId": "{{products.response.body.$.data[0].id}}",
  "locationKind": "Mandi",
  "mandiId": "{{adminMandi.response.body.$.data.id}}",
  "thresholdType": "PriceDrop",
  "thresholdPercent": 5
}

### 39b. Create a price-level alert rule — fires when the modal price crosses below ₹2,400 at this mandi
# @name createPriceBelowRule
POST {{host}}/api/v1/alert-rules
Authorization: Bearer {{accessToken}}
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "productId": "{{products.response.body.$.data[0].id}}",
  "locationKind": "Mandi",
  "mandiId": "{{adminMandi.response.body.$.data.id}}",
  "thresholdType": "PriceBelow",
  "thresholdPrice": 2400
}

### 39c. Raise the level on that rule (PriceAbove/PriceBelow rules update thresholdPrice, never thresholdPercent)
PUT {{host}}/api/v1/alert-rules/{{createPriceBelowRule.response.body.$.data.id}}
Authorization: Bearer {{accessToken}}
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "thresholdPrice": 2500,
  "isActive": true
}

### 40. My alert rules
GET {{host}}/api/v1/alert-rules
Authorization: Bearer {{accessToken}}

### 41. My triggered alerts — populated by EvaluateAlertRulesHandler when a matching price is recorded (see request 31)
GET {{host}}/api/v1/alerts
Authorization: Bearer {{accessToken}}

### 42. Mark an alert read
POST {{host}}/api/v1/alerts/{{createAlertRule.response.body.$.data.id}}/read
Authorization: Bearer {{accessToken}}

### 43. Delete an alert rule
DELETE {{host}}/api/v1/alert-rules/{{createAlertRule.response.body.$.data.id}}
Authorization: Bearer {{accessToken}}

### 43b. Delete the price-level alert rule
DELETE {{host}}/api/v1/alert-rules/{{createPriceBelowRule.response.body.$.data.id}}
Authorization: Bearer {{accessToken}}

