### --- Support (help & support) ---

### 72. FAQ for the Help & Support screen — seeded by SeedSupportFaq, resolved for Accept-Language
GET {{host}}/api/v1/localization/texts?keyPrefix=support.faq.
Authorization: Bearer {{accessToken}}
Accept-Language: hi

### 73. Contact channels — from the Support config section (validated at startup)
GET {{host}}/api/v1/support/contact
Authorization: Bearer {{accessToken}}

### 74. Raise a ticket — the ticket and its first message are written together
# @name createTicket
POST {{host}}/api/v1/support/tickets
Authorization: Bearer {{accessToken}}
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "category": "Data",
  "subject": "Onion price for APMC Pune looks wrong",
  "message": "Yesterday's modal price shows 1250 but the mandi board said 1400. Can you check the source?"
}

### 75. My tickets — last activity first
GET {{host}}/api/v1/support/tickets
Authorization: Bearer {{accessToken}}

### 76. One ticket with its full thread (owner only — someone else's id is a 404)
GET {{host}}/api/v1/support/tickets/{{createTicket.response.body.$.data.id}}
Authorization: Bearer {{accessToken}}

### 77. Admin queue — filters: status, category, search (subject, case-insensitive)
GET {{host}}/api/v1/admin/support/tickets?status=Open
Authorization: Bearer {{accessToken}}

### 78. Admin — one ticket with its thread (no owner filter)
GET {{host}}/api/v1/admin/support/tickets/{{createTicket.response.body.$.data.id}}
Authorization: Bearer {{accessToken}}

### 79. Admin reply — moves Open → InProgress and notifies the owner through the outbox
POST {{host}}/api/v1/admin/support/tickets/{{createTicket.response.body.$.data.id}}/messages
Authorization: Bearer {{accessToken}}
Content-Type: application/json

{ "message": "Thanks for flagging it. We re-checked Agmarknet and corrected yesterday's record." }

### 80. The notification the reply produced (support.reply.* copy, in the user's language)
GET {{host}}/api/v1/notifications
Authorization: Bearer {{accessToken}}

### 81. User reply — allowed while not Closed; on a Resolved ticket it reopens to Open
POST {{host}}/api/v1/support/tickets/{{createTicket.response.body.$.data.id}}/messages
Authorization: Bearer {{accessToken}}
Content-Type: application/json

{ "message": "Confirmed, the corrected price matches the board now. Thank you." }

### 82. Admin — resolve the ticket
PUT {{host}}/api/v1/admin/support/tickets/{{createTicket.response.body.$.data.id}}/status
Authorization: Bearer {{accessToken}}
Content-Type: application/json

{ "status": "Resolved" }

### 83. Admin — close it; Closed is terminal, so 79/81/82 all return 400 afterwards
PUT {{host}}/api/v1/admin/support/tickets/{{createTicket.response.body.$.data.id}}/status
Authorization: Bearer {{accessToken}}
Content-Type: application/json

{ "status": "Closed" }
